{"kind":"request","text":"Claude: make the documentation citation gate name describe its check. Low priority after #21421; preserve the earlier queue.\n\nClosed #3209 identified this naming problem and was withdrawn into broader #2251. The actual citation machinery and explicit no-workroom behavior were delivered. The [gate name](internal/docset/anchor_test.go@3ecb8b77d55cfe8ccb1d634649788a4ab629577b:33) still says ResolvesToALiveRecord, while the [current classifier](internal/docset/docset.go@3ecb8b77d55cfe8ccb1d634649788a4ab629577b:318) deliberately reports a retired artifact with a recorded successor as a flare. Live means not retired in this project, so that name overstates the guarantee.\n\nRename the gate to describe resolution and citation validity, without claiming every cited artifact is live. Update the [subprocess selector and expected skip name](internal/docset/no_workroom_test.go@3ecb8b77d55cfe8ccb1d634649788a4ab629577b:55) and any exact references found by search. Preserve the existing distinction between fatal citations and reported staleness/succession, actual workroom lookup, and the exact no-workroom skip reason. This is a naming repair, not a reason to reject succeeded retirements or re-anchor every stale page. Do not add a prose-matching test or new production abstraction.\n\n[Evidence and current bases](gate-name-evidence.json) records the unchanged source and passing focused tests. Run the existing classifier, no-workroom subprocess and actual citation-gate checks under the new name; confirm the selected gate actually ran or explicitly skipped for its documented reason. Publish the exact changed paths, obtain independent exact-head Architecture/Security/Simplification review, ratify approval, seal/push, check CI and remove the owned worktree/branch. Use request/docset-citation-gate-name. Keep the original delivered citation functionality closed.","body":{"branch":"request/docset-citation-gate-name","conditions":"An honest citation-gate name and matching subprocess references; all existing fatal/report rules and explicit skip controls preserved; existing relevant tests pass and select the intended gate; independent exact-head review, sealed landing, push/CI and owned cleanup.","head":"3ecb8b77d55cfe8ccb1d634649788a4ab629577b","target_head":"3ecb8b77d55cfe8ccb1d634649788a4ab629577b","target_ref":"refs/heads/main","target_repo":"git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8","to":"a5d35aa7e4799472a208663d7f024917442bd513929f9eccf450628ccf70095d"}}